cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ORB, please cite it as below."
title: "ORB: a tiny, from-scratch audio engine for agents"
abstract: >-
  ORB turns a one-line caption into a typed Spec, compiles the Spec to a
  deterministic DSP render at 48 kHz, and optionally refines it with a small
  neural detail model. It ships no pretrained weights and no samples.
authors:
  - family-names: "Maceo"
    given-names: "Marcos"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-16"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/stdevMac/orb-audio"
keywords:
  - audio
  - sound-effects
  - text-to-audio
  - procedural-audio
  - dsp
